{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國周三（28日）宣布，禁止3間中國基因公司進口產品，包括華大集團、華大基因和華大智造。</p><p>美國國土安全部指，該些公司涉嫌在新疆參與對維吾爾族及其他少數民族的強迫勞動。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T02:22:13.323914+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T01:47:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T14:58:15.701211+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T02:18:20.147163+00:00","content_hash":"3c18d637d49cb3ea33c6d0eac8b8172b94b55fe651ddc767482133380e6c12c1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}